; The memory-card mouth, a shade wider and taller than the 0.042 x 0.008 edge the
; card enters on, so the seated card reads as sitting IN a socket rather than
; pushed into flat plastic. Recessed into the front face, not proud of it.
[sub_resource type="BoxMesh" id="BoxMesh_memcard_recess"]
size = Vector3(0.046, 0.012, 0.012)

