; Wii Remote pairing. An ordinary cabinet button in every respect — same cap, same
; shape, same touch behaviour, same flat label — just placed BEHIND the transport
; row rather than in it. The box is only 0.3 m across, so a fourth cap on that row
; would hang over the edge; the top face has plenty of depth spare.
;
; Only a Wii shows it at all — system.gd calls set_active().
[node name="SyncButton" type="Area3D" parent="." unique_id=1919000101]
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0.06, 0.05)
